  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It keeps the aggressive behavior of an adult Toe Biter, using combos, powerful attacks, area hits, and an unblockable ranged attack. The main difference is its elemental infusion, which changes its resistances and the effects it can apply during combat.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "Much of the difficulty comes from reaching it and from the limited space available for the fight. Its area is high above the ground, and one bad movement can make you fall out of the arena or land in a web. Before reaching it, you also need to complete a fair amount of parkour and pass through areas filled with different spiders.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "The route to its area contains many spiders and other threats, so you may arrive after already spending health, healing items, or durability. Once you reach its position, the limited space becomes the main problem in the fight.",
  "strategy": "Try to arrive with enough resources and recover before starting the fight whenever possible. During combat, avoid overly wide movements or dodging toward the edges, because falling from the platform or landing on a web can leave you completely exposed. Always check its infusion and use Fresh → Sour, Sour → Spicy, and Spicy → Fresh. Also avoid Slashing weapons and prioritize maintaining a safe position rather than aggressively chasing it around the confined area.",
